# Use only an authorized local/staging account. No production credentials in this file.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@application = replace-with-authorized-fixture-application
@contract = replace-with-authorized-fixture-contract

### Contract administration (real superadmin session cookie required)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/partner-contracts

### Participant agreements (real verified participant session required)
GET {{base}}/api/partners/contracts

### Private generated PDF (admin or exact participant session required)
GET {{base}}/api/partners/contracts/{{contract}}/documents/source

### Private completed PDF
GET {{base}}/api/partners/contracts/{{contract}}/documents/signed

### Admin execution evidence
GET {{base}}/api/partners/contracts/{{contract}}/documents/audit

### Queue authoritative reconciliation (superadmin session required)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/partner-contracts
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{base}}

{"action":"reconcile","id":"{{contract}}"}

### Prepare a non-binding preview with local draft mode (reviewed identity and schedule required)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/partner-contracts
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{base}}

{"action":"prepare","id":"{{application}}"}

### Process bounded pending work (superadmin session required)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/partner-contracts
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{base}}

{"action":"run"}

# Legal approvals, provider setup and manual activation are deliberately exercised
# through the reviewed admin forms or isolated automated tests, never as one-click
# production fixture commands. See ../Developer_Guides/PARTNER_CONTRACTS.md.
